      "note": "Provisional machine alignment by Codex, Tibetan-first independent proposal. Explicit English order reverses the first two Tibetan consequence and karma mentions: initial las and 'bras bu attach to original karma and eventual consequences, while dge mi dge'i las attaches to virtuous and non-virtuous karma or actions. sde pa owns the first schools only; the higher/lower schools repetitions are supplied. rang gi is contextualized as Buddhist but that is not a lexical equivalent, so omitted. snga logs bar du is distributed over the temporal frame and omitted, not nulled. don byed is the established functional-activity compound and owns affecting; anything remains unwrapped. mi nus and mi 'thad are grammatical phrase recasts at depth 3; the latter changes an unfitting relationship into the impossibility of having it, excluding supplied you. Inflected rtag par/rtag pas retain their full Tibetan surface form while English supplies one unchanging per occurrence."
